    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1730289307527\" id=\"item-672219adbbc98b0aaab0a516\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-3ca35780bc3cc8d50bf3\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us :  </strong>PropertyMedia Japan specializes in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floorplans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bedrooms:</strong> 3 elegantly appointed bedrooms designed with maximum comfort in mind. Each room boasts large windows, providing abundant natural light and serene views that ensure restful nights and invigorating mornings.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bathrooms:</strong> 2 spacious bathrooms outfitted with the latest in contemporary fixtures and chic finishes. The master bathroom includes a luxurious deep-soaking tub and a separate glass-enclosed shower, creating a spa-like environment for relaxation.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Living Room:</strong> The heart of the home features an expansive living area with plush carpeting and tasteful decor, perfect for family gatherings or a cozy evening by the fireplace. Large, energy-efficient windows frame picturesque views and fill the space with warmth and light.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Kitchen:</strong> A state-of-the-art kitchen with modern appliances, sleek cabinetry, and stone countertops, integrated seamlessly with an open dining area that makes entertaining a delight. The thoughtful layout maximizes space and functionality, while the breakfast bar serves as a focal point for morning interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Garage:</strong> Includes a convenient single-car garage, offering ample storage and parking solutions with additional space for outdoor equipment, ideal for an outdoor lifestyle. </p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Outdoor Living:</strong> Enjoy the beauty of New Zealand from your private outdoor deck, meticulously landscaped to harmonize with the natural environment. It's perfect for alfresco dining or simply soaking up the tranquil surroundings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Constructed with meticulous attention to detail, Pinefield combines modern design with practical living solutions. This property is ideal for families seeking a harmonious blend of luxury and comfort in one of New Zealand\u2019s most sought-after destinations. Whether it\u2019s your main residence or a holiday home, Pinefield promises a unique living experience in the heart of New Zealand.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspect-ratio&quot;:&quot;square&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;67221a3de950d23dba277597&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;lightbox&quot;:false,&quot;padding&quot;:20,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;thumbnails-per-row&quot;:4,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;67221a3de950d23dba277597&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1730258888192_476174\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"67221a5b93ff1d233046fa68\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1730288234147-AOXMBLVBNFA8EFNTWWZP/Pinefield+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%281%29.jpg\" alt=\"Pinefield Niseko Kutchan Hokkaido Japan Real Estate Property Agent Photographer Videographer (1).jpg\" /></noscript><img class=\"thumb-image\" elementtiming=\"system-gallery-block-stacked\" data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1730288234147-AOXMBLVBNFA8EFNTWWZP/Pinefield+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%281%29.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1730288234147-AOXMBLVBNFA8EFNTWWZP/Pinefield+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%281%29.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"4000x2670\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"Pinefield Niseko Kutchan Hokkaido Japan Real Estate Property Agent Photographer Videographer (1).jpg\" data-load=\"false\" data-image-id=\"67221a5b93ff1d233046fa68\" data-type=\"image\" />\n            \n          </div>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"67221a4726a5880b1a02e312\" data-type=